WEBVTT

00:06.250 --> 00:11.000
Flowers of love for the merciful Goddess Lirenna!

00:11.920 --> 00:16.250
Flowers of love for the merciful Goddess Lirenna!

00:24.460 --> 00:26.920
It's here, the fateful day we've been waiting for.

00:26.920 --> 00:27.830
Yeah!

00:28.080 --> 00:30.040
The Academy of Magic's Festival of Gratitude,

00:30.290 --> 00:33.710
which means it's the day of the showdown
with the Witch of Yore.

00:34.130 --> 00:36.130
That's fine, Kobayashi,

00:36.420 --> 00:37.130
Hmm?

00:37.130 --> 00:38.330
but what...

00:41.420 --> 00:43.420
<b>CERTAIN VICTORY</b>

00:41.420 --> 00:43.420
<b>Defeat the</b>

00:41.420 --> 00:43.420
<b>Witch of Yore!</b>

00:41.960 --> 00:43.130
...is all this?

00:43.460 --> 00:47.000
We're gonna stand up to
the Witch of Yore right along with them!

00:47.500 --> 00:51.750
This is just a very basic way to show my support!

00:51.750 --> 00:53.130
"Basic"?

00:53.670 --> 00:57.460
But I do get what you mean.
We can't just be silent onlookers anymore.

00:57.790 --> 00:58.380
Yeah.

00:58.920 --> 01:06.710
I always liked Magikoi, but I never thought I'd grow
to love and cherish Liese-tan and the others so much.

01:06.920 --> 01:10.460
I know! It's like they're really close buddies.

01:11.130 --> 01:14.830
That's why I definitely want all of them to survive.

01:12.540 --> 01:16.040
<b>The Royal Academy of Magic-Courtyard</b>

01:12.540 --> 01:16.040
<b>Academy of Magic Festival of Gratitude</b>

01:16.210 --> 01:19.750
Ienai kimochi ni kizuite

01:19.750 --> 01:25.880
Ibitsu de bukiyou na kotoba de tsutaeru kara

01:26.130 --> 01:29.040
Kitto kimi ni

01:38.290 --> 01:41.250
Itsumo gomakashichau yo

01:41.250 --> 01:43.670
(Doki doki barenai youni)

01:43.750 --> 01:48.920
Zenbu mabushisugiru kimi no sei dayo

01:49.170 --> 01:51.960
Kawaiku nante narenaiyo

01:51.960 --> 01:53.710
(Datte niawanai desho?)

01:53.710 --> 01:56.540
Sono me ni utsuru sora mo

01:56.540 --> 01:59.830
Massugu mitsumerarenakute

01:59.830 --> 02:05.170
Uso darake no sekai ni itsumade iru no?

02:05.170 --> 02:10.080
Kono mamaja nanimo kaerarenai

02:10.250 --> 02:12.790
Sonna no iya dayo

02:12.790 --> 02:18.920
Moshimo kamisama ga kimochi tsugete kuretatoshitemo

02:18.920 --> 02:24.210
Itsuka jibun no koe de kimi no koto ga suki dato tsutaetai

02:24.460 --> 02:33.000
Moshimo ibitsudemo taisetsu na omoi dokoka kiechau mae ni

02:33.500 --> 02:36.210
Yuuki dasu kara

02:46.710 --> 02:50.670
<b>The Lirene Flower, the Ball, and the Witch</b>

03:07.540 --> 03:09.830
I'm so glad you're here, Lieselotte!

03:13.920 --> 03:18.960
It is fortunate to see you are just
the same as ever, Your Highness.

03:20.250 --> 03:22.460
I see you've changed your hairstyle.

03:24.170 --> 03:27.710
It's just like my mother's. It looks lovely on you!

03:28.000 --> 03:31.880
I-I wasn't imitating Queen Tiana's look, mind you!

03:32.250 --> 03:38.420
The rain this morning curled my hair
such that I simply had no choice.

03:39.170 --> 03:40.920
Ah... I see.

03:41.420 --> 03:42.630
Liese...!

03:50.420 --> 03:53.290
His Highness was so kind
as to compliment me, and yet...

03:54.000 --> 03:55.080
Lieselotte, dear?

03:56.880 --> 03:58.000
Queen Tiana!

03:58.500 --> 04:00.380
I see you have your locks curled today.

04:00.790 --> 04:01.920
Oh, yes!

04:02.290 --> 04:05.830
Well, your hair always looks so splendid,

04:06.080 --> 04:09.250
and His Highness said before that the hairstyle was cute,

04:09.250 --> 04:10.580
so I tried imitating it.

04:11.170 --> 04:12.880
You look absolutely precious.

04:13.210 --> 04:15.960
Oh! Thank you so much!

04:17.330 --> 04:20.670
Why is it I have no problem saying
what I mean in front of Queen Tiana?

04:20.670 --> 04:25.420
Oh, I'm sure His Highness must hate me even more now.

04:27.790 --> 04:31.130
Your hairstyle, it really is adorable...

04:33.460 --> 04:35.750
but I think it might be missing something.

04:41.210 --> 04:42.580
What flower is this?

04:42.580 --> 04:46.330
I'm sure you're aware that we in the royal family

04:46.330 --> 04:51.330
each have a symbol to use when
marking our favorite belongings.

04:51.330 --> 04:52.710
Y-yes.

04:53.290 --> 04:55.540
Can you tell me what Sieg's symbol is?

04:55.540 --> 04:56.960
A lirene flower!

04:57.170 --> 05:02.080
His Highness was born with the same eye and hair color
of the Creation Goddess, Her Holiness Lirenna,

05:02.330 --> 05:05.330
so the lirene flower that the goddess
supposedly cherished...

05:05.630 --> 05:06.920
Then perhaps-!?

05:06.920 --> 05:09.000
Precisely. This flower is a lirene.

05:10.250 --> 05:16.080
But it's such a rare flower! Not only is it His Highness's
symbol, I hear it has the power to dispel evil.

05:16.080 --> 05:17.960
I-I couldn't possibly!

05:17.960 --> 05:18.880
It's fine.

05:19.210 --> 05:25.630
It's true they say it wards off evil, but I would
like to give you this as a good luck charm.

05:25.920 --> 05:27.080
A "good luck charm"?

05:27.080 --> 05:27.830
Yes.

05:28.580 --> 05:32.880
So that you and Sieg can get along.

05:55.880 --> 06:03.880
O Goddess Lirenna, Creator of all things, we give thanks
for the bountiful harvest that bless our lands.

06:14.540 --> 06:17.880
Grant us with the strength we need

06:18.750 --> 06:20.330
to withstand the harsh winter to come.

06:23.880 --> 06:27.170
The ritual for the Festival of Gratitude
is taking place with due solemnity.

06:27.170 --> 06:29.460
Will you just look at those beautiful lirene flowers!

06:29.460 --> 06:34.290
They really are! Not only is it the
Goddess Lirenna's flower, but also Sieg's symbol

06:34.290 --> 06:41.290
and a special flower that quietly represented Lieselotte's
feelings when she couldn't express her love outright.

06:41.290 --> 06:45.920
Wow, that lirene flower looks
especially good on Liese-tan today.

06:46.330 --> 06:49.880
I'm sure the Goddess Lirenna would be
all smiles seeing how beautiful Liese-tan looks!

06:50.080 --> 06:53.380
Hey, wasn't there a male deity as well?

06:53.380 --> 06:57.630
Yup. Apparently there was a pair
of male and female deities to begin with.

06:57.630 --> 06:59.290
According to legend,

06:59.920 --> 07:05.000
the male deity Kuon fought the Witch of Yore
to protect a human he loved,

07:05.000 --> 07:07.130
and used up all of his power.

07:07.790 --> 07:12.420
They say the loss of her counterpart
threw Lirenna into the depths of grief.

07:12.670 --> 07:13.880
I see...

07:15.040 --> 07:19.580
A deity who disappeared from the world
because he protected someone he loved, huh?

07:19.580 --> 07:21.170
I feel a little sorry for him.

07:21.540 --> 07:22.250
Mm-hm.

07:30.630 --> 07:35.790
Now that the prayers have been offered,
it's time for the magnificent ball to begin!

07:36.330 --> 07:40.960
Look at all the students and
professors gathering in their finery!

07:41.380 --> 07:47.210
Okay, which one of you lovely ladies wants
to dance with me, the pretty boy priest Artur?!

07:47.750 --> 07:49.040
Me!

07:49.040 --> 07:50.130
Wow!

07:50.130 --> 07:52.420
You playboy! You're such a player, Art!

07:52.420 --> 07:55.830
What happened to the priestly solemnity
you had just a moment ago?!

07:56.670 --> 07:59.250
Oh, and now there's Fabian, too!

07:59.540 --> 08:01.630
He looks a little nervous.

08:03.540 --> 08:05.420
Huh? Cecilie?

08:05.420 --> 08:07.500
But she isn't a student at the academy.

08:07.500 --> 08:10.000
It's all good! Cuteness is justice!

08:21.710 --> 08:27.420
Ooh, the usually prim and elegant Lieselotte
appears in a dashing royal guard's uniform!

08:27.420 --> 08:30.080
But that just makes it better! I can't!

08:30.080 --> 08:32.500
She looks perfect with Sieg!

08:37.630 --> 08:38.750
What do I do?

08:39.330 --> 08:42.380
I've never danced in front of people, ever.

08:43.790 --> 08:46.670
I enjoyed practicing with Lieselotte...

08:49.540 --> 08:51.710
...but I don't even have a formal partner.

08:53.250 --> 08:55.710
Really? But it's such a beautiful dress!

08:56.130 --> 08:59.210
Mm-hm! Go ahead and alter it "magicombat" style.

08:59.540 --> 09:00.540
Don't worry.

09:00.790 --> 09:01.630
Huh?

09:02.380 --> 09:06.000
To tell you the truth, this dress
sort of represents a memory.

09:06.380 --> 09:07.130
A "memory"?

09:07.460 --> 09:10.130
But you know, that's a secret.

09:11.040 --> 09:13.790
After Mommy lent me her dress, too...

09:14.580 --> 09:15.920
Y-yes?!

09:17.040 --> 09:17.880
Miss Fiene.

09:18.080 --> 09:19.130
Sir Bal!

09:20.000 --> 09:22.880
His Highness and Lord Artur Richter told me,

09:23.170 --> 09:24.670
that I should go and fetch you.

09:25.130 --> 09:27.040
Huh? Fetch me?!

09:27.040 --> 09:28.750
I'm not a child, you know!

09:29.500 --> 09:32.080
I would love for you to dance with me.

09:32.630 --> 09:33.250
Uh...?

09:34.170 --> 09:37.830
They say the last person you dance with on
the day of the Festival of Gratitude

09:38.580 --> 09:41.380
will get through the harsh winter with you, together.

09:41.710 --> 09:43.420
So... please.

09:48.540 --> 09:52.580
You're late! I might have gone dancing
with someone else, you realize!

09:52.830 --> 09:56.420
Well, it's true you are very charming.

09:58.080 --> 09:59.170
Did someone ask you already?!

09:59.540 --> 10:01.420
Of course not, jeez.

10:01.960 --> 10:04.880
Lead me properly, all right?

10:05.130 --> 10:06.630
U-understood.

10:27.170 --> 10:28.380
How lovely!

10:28.460 --> 10:30.500
Such a picture perfect couple!

10:39.540 --> 10:43.710
When one is wearing a mask,
it's not right to mention their name.

10:43.710 --> 10:46.290
I was hoping you could help out, Leon.

10:50.920 --> 10:52.210
She's like a fairy!

10:58.170 --> 10:59.000
Could that be...?!

11:01.830 --> 11:02.960
Impossible!

11:16.040 --> 11:18.830
August, watch over us.

11:19.210 --> 11:23.210
Please, please let everyone be all right.

11:28.500 --> 11:31.880
I always thought, ever since our initial encounter...

11:33.880 --> 11:35.710
that this isn't the first time we've met.

11:39.580 --> 11:41.170
I want to protect you.

11:42.630 --> 11:45.710
To make sure that this time, I don't have to lose you.

11:47.630 --> 11:49.790
Why would I say that?

11:50.330 --> 11:54.420
M-maybe it was something Lord Endoe
and Lady Kobayashie said?

11:55.630 --> 11:57.670
Uh, um...

11:58.330 --> 11:59.380
I feel the same way.

12:01.460 --> 12:06.880
I swear to love you and protect you through,
with everything I have to offer.

12:09.380 --> 12:11.630
Thank... you...

12:16.750 --> 12:20.920
Just for this brief moment,
we're in our own, romantic world.

12:21.380 --> 12:22.170
Still...

12:23.210 --> 12:27.880
Your Highness, the time for us
to confront the Witch of Yore draws near.

12:28.290 --> 12:30.040
O-of course.

12:30.500 --> 12:33.250
...I suppose this isn't the time for a romantic mood.

12:33.790 --> 12:37.130
You said the witch will appear once the ball ends?

12:37.130 --> 12:40.290
That's what I've heard from
Lord Endoh and Lady Kobayashee.

12:41.000 --> 12:43.500
We're fully prepared to counter this foe.

12:44.040 --> 12:47.460
My father, General Bruno Riefenstahl, his knights,

12:47.750 --> 12:51.920
as well as Fabian and Cecilie are already in position.

12:52.500 --> 12:53.420
Fabian, too?

12:53.420 --> 12:55.460
Yes, actually...

12:55.710 --> 12:58.630
I have to go get in position now.

12:58.630 --> 12:59.290
See you.

12:59.290 --> 13:00.080
Wait!

13:00.500 --> 13:01.290
Huh?

13:01.540 --> 13:02.380
Let me...

13:02.880 --> 13:04.040
Let me go with you.

13:04.040 --> 13:06.540
Uh, but aren't you supposed to come later?

13:06.750 --> 13:12.330
Yeah, I want to stay with the girl
I want the last dance with.

13:12.330 --> 13:17.420
Th-then will you escort me to the back courtyard?

13:17.580 --> 13:18.630
With pleasure!

13:19.750 --> 13:23.130
Cecilie herself told me, with such joy in her voice.

13:24.540 --> 13:27.880
I can almost hear Lady Kobayashee's shouts of delight.

13:29.170 --> 13:32.130
Fabian's gonna grow up to be one gem of a guy!

13:33.040 --> 13:36.210
Listen, Liese. Are you sure you want to join the fight?

13:36.290 --> 13:37.380
Of course I do.

13:37.710 --> 13:40.670
I have no fear for the Witch of Yore anymore.

13:41.330 --> 13:44.790
I would much rather cut the witch down myself.

13:45.420 --> 13:49.830
Above all, I want to be by your side,
whatever the circumstances.

13:50.130 --> 13:51.000
Liese...

13:51.000 --> 13:57.420
If I had to wait here for your return, that would
be far more terrifying than confronting the witch.

14:01.540 --> 14:04.170
Then perhaps we could go hand in hand,

14:05.080 --> 14:07.580
just like we did that day we first met.

14:09.920 --> 14:12.290
I-I'm not sure I remember that ever happening.

14:12.750 --> 14:15.210
You were so cute at the age of five, Liese!

14:15.380 --> 14:19.170
But I think you're even more adorable now.

14:19.170 --> 14:20.330
Wh-wha...

14:20.790 --> 14:22.290
Oh, honestly!

14:23.460 --> 14:26.420
Fine. Then we shall go hand in hand.

14:26.710 --> 14:29.130
I will feel less nervous that way.

14:29.630 --> 14:33.460
But once we get to the back courtyard,
I ask that you to let go of my hand.

14:33.460 --> 14:36.250
Sure. Well, for today, anyway.

14:38.750 --> 14:41.580
Once the Festival of Gratitude ends and winter comes,

14:41.580 --> 14:45.830
I want us to be together past
the winter and far, far beyond.

14:46.790 --> 14:49.580
I want to make sure I keep this hand firmly in my grasp,

14:50.500 --> 14:55.500
and never let go of the joy of being by your side.

14:57.130 --> 15:00.130
<b>In the Grand Hall</b>

14:57.130 --> 15:00.130
<b>Lieselotte</b>

14:57.130 --> 15:00.130
<b>Then we shall go hand in hand.</b>

14:57.130 --> 15:00.130
<b>I will feel less nervous that way.</b>

14:58.540 --> 14:59.790
It's almost time.

15:00.330 --> 15:01.250
Mm-hm.

15:01.540 --> 15:05.250
Just a bit more to get to the best
happy end to end all happy ends!

15:05.670 --> 15:08.630
But that also means the game will end.

15:09.170 --> 15:13.580
Once we finish the game, I won't be able
to spend time with Kobayashi like this anymore.

15:19.380 --> 15:20.130
Huh?!

15:21.250 --> 15:22.580
Wait, what's going on?!

15:34.040 --> 15:35.080
Could this be it?

15:36.210 --> 15:39.210
First Platoon, go over and stand guard in the forest!

15:39.210 --> 15:39.920
Yes, sir!

15:41.080 --> 15:41.920
General!

15:42.290 --> 15:43.630
Let me go with them!

15:43.920 --> 15:44.670
Hmm?

15:44.670 --> 15:46.330
Fabian! I'll go too!

15:46.330 --> 15:49.790
Cecilie, you stay and protect Miss Liese and the others.

15:51.920 --> 15:53.080
You be careful, now.

15:53.080 --> 15:53.830
I will!

15:54.920 --> 15:56.000
Fabian...

15:59.960 --> 16:01.290
What is that eerie smoke?!

16:05.250 --> 16:06.580
What in the world is that?!

16:17.250 --> 16:19.880
The Witch of Yore!

16:24.330 --> 16:25.250
Ready, aim...

16:26.080 --> 16:27.040
fire!

16:37.920 --> 16:38.710
What's that?!

16:41.710 --> 16:46.380
What's going on?! I thought the witch
doesn't resurrect until after the ball ends!

16:42.960 --> 16:50.040
<b>The Royal Academy of Magic-Outside the Grand Hall</b>

16:42.960 --> 16:48.080
<b>The Witch of Yore appeared!!</b>

16:47.080 --> 16:53.080
The events have diverged so much from the usual story,
maybe the timing of her appearance changed, too!

16:53.080 --> 16:54.130
What?!

16:57.170 --> 16:58.250
What of the students?!

16:58.580 --> 17:01.630
Don't worry, we had them all evacuate to a safe location!

17:07.580 --> 17:08.630
What is happening?!

17:08.630 --> 17:11.000
Your Highness, the moment has arrived.

17:11.960 --> 17:14.540
It must be the Witch of Yore!

17:20.210 --> 17:21.080
Father!

17:23.210 --> 17:24.000
Father!

17:24.500 --> 17:26.750
Th-the witch...

17:27.540 --> 17:28.670
Where did she go?!

17:31.540 --> 17:34.540
All right. Please leave the rest to us.

17:41.880 --> 17:42.790
The witch?!

17:49.500 --> 17:51.130
That's the witch?!

17:51.630 --> 17:54.420
How dare you get in my way...

17:55.170 --> 17:58.080
I-I'm sorry Miss Liese. I let my guard down...

17:58.540 --> 17:59.670
Fabian!

17:59.960 --> 18:01.750
Watch out, Princess!

18:01.920 --> 18:04.130
My vessel...

18:04.130 --> 18:06.130
Where is my vessel...?

18:05.210 --> 18:07.880
Is she trying to eliminate Fabian
because of his powerful magic?

18:08.250 --> 18:10.630
Why you, let go of Fabian-!

18:10.630 --> 18:11.790
Hold on, Liese!

18:12.170 --> 18:14.500
From here, you'll hurt Fabian as well!

18:14.500 --> 18:16.830
But Sieg! Fabian needs help!

18:22.710 --> 18:25.000
That was the forbidden curse, Orb of Darkness!

18:25.580 --> 18:26.540
Fabian!

18:26.790 --> 18:27.920
Miudaja!

18:30.920 --> 18:31.960
Nice work, Fiene!

18:36.750 --> 18:38.290
Oh! You're Prof-

18:38.290 --> 18:42.250
It's not right to ask someone their name
when they're wearing a mask.

18:42.630 --> 18:44.460
I suppose you could call me...

18:44.830 --> 18:47.130
"Karlchen" for the time being.

18:47.380 --> 18:48.580
Oh, yesss!

18:48.580 --> 18:54.920
Who would've thought Leo... I mean, this mysterious
mage of justice, Karlchen, would join in here?!

18:57.290 --> 19:00.670
This completes the Reverse Harem Route roster!

19:00.670 --> 19:02.630
There's no way they can lose now!

19:02.920 --> 19:05.250
But don't let your guards down just yet!

19:05.250 --> 19:07.170
Rah, rah, Liese!

19:07.170 --> 19:09.290
Let's go, let's go, Sieg!

19:09.290 --> 19:11.960
Come on, everyone, do your best!

19:24.920 --> 19:26.750
Sieg! Use fire against ice!

19:27.040 --> 19:28.580
Liese! I need fire!

19:28.830 --> 19:30.750
Right! Leave it to me!

19:34.960 --> 19:36.130
Thank you, Liese.

19:36.380 --> 19:37.670
That was nothing.

19:38.500 --> 19:39.290
Let's go!

19:39.290 --> 19:40.000
Right!

19:45.380 --> 19:46.330
Sir Bal!

19:47.130 --> 19:48.170
Wait, Fiene!

19:48.170 --> 19:49.130
Use purify!

19:49.500 --> 19:50.250
Right!

19:50.630 --> 19:51.420
Fiene.

19:52.040 --> 19:53.040
Let me lend a hand.

19:54.130 --> 19:55.250
Thank you!

19:55.630 --> 19:56.880
Lanishke!

20:08.080 --> 20:10.460
You honestly think you can take me on?

20:11.250 --> 20:14.880
Maybe in a hundred years!
Then perhaps you'll fare better!

20:18.960 --> 20:19.750
Yaaah!

20:19.750 --> 20:21.130
Hah! Yah!

20:23.750 --> 20:24.630
Thanks!

20:24.830 --> 20:25.880
Not a problem.

20:34.630 --> 20:35.460
Fabian!

20:35.830 --> 20:37.500
Are you all right, Miss Liese?

20:40.670 --> 20:42.880
Hey! The Witch of Yore ran away!

20:43.460 --> 20:44.710
You get back here!

20:44.960 --> 20:46.080
Miss Liese!

20:48.170 --> 20:49.750
Liese, wait! Don't go alone!

20:50.040 --> 20:53.250
No! The witch is trying to possess Liese-tan!

20:56.920 --> 20:58.130
I won't let you get away!

21:00.670 --> 21:02.330
I'll take care of you myself!

21:26.130 --> 21:28.630
The lirene flower...!

21:32.710 --> 21:34.040
Wait, what?!

21:51.460 --> 21:52.460
Liese!

21:53.790 --> 21:54.710
Lieselotte!

21:54.710 --> 21:55.750
Miss Liese!

21:56.330 --> 21:57.540
Lieselotte!

21:58.830 --> 22:03.250
Your Highness... please know that...

22:04.210 --> 22:05.710
Liese!

22:06.170 --> 22:08.830
I... love...

22:10.250 --> 22:12.630
Doom... Doom!

22:17.380 --> 22:18.000
What's happening?!

22:18.000 --> 22:18.670
What?!

22:19.710 --> 22:22.630
S...Sieg!

22:23.380 --> 22:25.750
LIESE!!

22:25.750 --> 22:28.750
<b>Lieselotte has been engulfed in flames!</b>

22:29.420 --> 22:30.750
How could this happen?

22:34.380 --> 22:37.290
NOOOOO!

22:37.880 --> 22:42.250
LIESE-TAN!

22:43.670 --> 22:49.670
